===Gym Leaders and Wally rematches===
After receiving the National Pokédex, [[Wally]] and the [[Gym Leader]]s can request [[rematch]]es through the [[PokéNav]]'s Match Call.
*The Gym Leaders can be rematched to a [[Double Battle]], and the only way to rematch with them is to wait until they are ready. Here the Match Call will alert you.
*Wally can be repeatedly rematched in a similar way to normal trainers with the exception that you do not need to be in Victory Road and is checked each time you enter. Wally is located near the exit of the Victory Road. He is the only opponent which the Match Call doesn't alert you about a rematch.

