==Steven Continues His Training==
===Mossdeep City===
Return to [[Mossdeep City]] and pay a visit to {{steven}}'s house. He's not home, but he has left a note for you on the table. It says that he plans to do some soul-searching as he continues his training on the road, and doesn't intend to return home for quite some time. He asks a favor of you, to take the Poké Ball on the desk. It contains a {{p|Beldum}}, his favorite Pokémon. He ends the note by saying that he hopes your paths cross again someday.

